1639 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In September\054 I reached out to Anastasia on a recommendation \024 and it turned out to be one of the best decisions for our family\056\n\nFrom the first meetings\054 it felt like a rare match\056 Anastasia is incredibly tactful and truly gets into the family\031s way of life\054 listens carefully to everyone\054 and turns that understanding into a space that feels cohesive\054 calm\054 and genuinely \034ours\056\035\n\nThe interior isn\031t just beautiful \024 it reflects our character and daily rhythm\056 Every decision is considered\054 every detail is functional\056 \n\nRead more)
     /K [ 19 ]
     /P 1640 0 R
     /Pg 1601 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
