1645 0 obj
  << /ActualText (With Anastasia\054 we worked on our first apartment in Dubai\056 As a couple\054 we had completely different ideas of what the interior should be\072 one of us wanted brightness and character\054 the other wanted calm and minimalism\056 Anastasia didn\031t just find a compromise \024 she understood both of us and brought it together into a cohesive style that felt very \034ours\035\056\n\nThe apartment ended up with many unique finds \024 and almost every guest asks where a particular piece is from\056\n\nRead more)
     /K [ 22 ]
